Package: pixy
Version: 0.0.0
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Depends: libc6, libasound2, libwayland-client0
Maintainer: Juan Pablo Lozano <libredeb@gmail.com>
Description: Fullscreen music player for GamerCard
 Pixy is a fullscreen, controller-friendly music player built for
 GamerCard. It ships with a small example library (free/royalty-free
 sample tracks) under /home/gamercard/Music so you have something to
 play right after installing, and it is meant to be replaced with your
 own local music collection.
